{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>黃澤林與康堤分手後火速戀上譚旻萱，女方隨即被網民強烈質疑無縫接軌。譚旻萱前男友區顯揚在社交平台連環發布限時動態 …</p><p></p>\n<p>黃澤林與康堤分手後火速戀上譚旻萱，女方隨即被網民強烈質疑無縫接軌。譚旻萱前男友區顯揚在社交平台連環發布限時動態，當中一張沾滿綠色顏料手掌照片瞬間引爆網絡熱話。這場牽涉多人的感情風波背後隱藏著令人震驚劈腿疑雲。\n</p>\n<h2>餐廳老闆前男友連環發文 疑暗示「被帽」</h2>\n<p>譚旻萱與黃澤林爆出新戀情後，其37歲餐廳老闆前男友區顯揚隨即在Instagram連續發布三個限時動態。他首先上載一張黑白照片，接著貼出一張沾滿綠色顏料手掌特寫，並配文表示「不如大家教下我點洗哩啲 水溶性色素仲好啦」。最後他再發布一張洗乾淨手掌照片，直指「冼面奶洗得甩 唔怪得啲女仔落咗妝差咁遠」。這系列極具暗示意味照片迅速在網絡瘋傳，大批網民推測他正以綠色顏料強烈暗示自己慘遭背叛並戴上綠帽。</p>\n<h2>譚旻萱與區顯揚互相取消追蹤關係徹底決裂</h2>\n<p>面對外界對綠色手掌照片瘋狂揣測，區顯揚在社交平台明確表達不想再捲入女方私事。他在黑白動態中直言「識我嘅就唔好問我 唔好再send比我 我唔係幾想睇到 人哋嘅事我唔清楚」，強烈要求外界停止轉發相關資訊。目前譚旻萱與區顯揚已經在社交平台上互相取消追蹤，雙方關係正式畫上句號。女方至今尚未對無縫接軌及劈腿指控作出任何公開回應，令整件感情糾紛持續發酵。\n</p>\n<h2>譚旻萱3月曾與舊愛穿情侶裝滑雪高調放閃</h2>\n<p>回顧譚旻萱過往情史，她於2023年曾大方認愛導演男友Christopher，當時更公開表示「好感激大家都畀適當空間我哋」。然而這段戀情悄悄結束後，她便與身兼排球教練及餐廳老闆區顯揚低調相戀。就在今年3月，男方曾上載二人坐吊車去滑雪背影照，女伴身穿灰白色豹紋滑雪裝，而譚旻萱同一時期亦發布了穿著同款服裝單人照。</p>\n<h2>網民起底區顯揚曾參與戀愛真人騷《35+LOVE》</h2>\n<p>事件曝光後引發網民激烈討論，不少人留言直斥「換畫速度快過翻書」、「綠色手掌真係好大怨氣」。同時大批網民對區顯揚進行大起底，發現身高182cm他曾參與ViuTV戀愛真人騷《35+LOVE》。他在節目中自爆擁有10次戀愛經驗，最長一段關係達6年，當時更與趙慧珊（Aka）擦出火花。\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179307130678418468_13062066686ae018cb37089.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"qST3rKvF3piR_LJMvrvo51T3KOHYsOcWZgYKR2YGCkc.jpeg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179307130678418468_13062066686ae018cb37089.jpg\" width=\"807\"/></a><figcaption>Mandy與身兼排球教練及餐廳老闆區顯揚低調相戀（圖片來源：IG@austinauhinyeung）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179307130956445532_18166637076ae018ce414d7.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"INgmFQrzzVSN2zZBk2TQsUvDv8Xzcti4Oirhhzoq4Yc.jpeg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179307130956445532_18166637076ae018ce414d7.jpg\" width=\"807\"/></a><figcaption>連環發文疑暗示「被帽」（圖片來源：IG@austinauhinyeung）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179307131491539540_13564357826ae018d353d4f.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"mcySqZqWpxTeM6-PhKjda4sKiwur9YvNZf9ojWX_aI0.jpeg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179307131491539540_13564357826ae018d353d4f.jpg\" width=\"807\"/></a><figcaption>大批網民推測他正以綠色顏料強烈暗示自己慘遭背叛並戴上綠帽。（圖片來源：IG@austinauhinyeung）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/17930713182323305_17118304496ae018d67d6ae.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"wOfAII7AD_BDzyL091grK-wW6U9Z7X1X7RN8XO0TfFw.jpeg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/17930713182323305_17118304496ae018d67d6ae.jpg\" width=\"807\"/></a><figcaption>疑似嘲諷女方落妝差得遠（圖片來源：IG@austinauhinyeung）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179307132052268357_4232655406ae018d913b58.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"austinauhinyeung_1773580675_3853396394477068339_207965317.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179307132052268357_4232655406ae018d913b58.jpg\" width=\"807\"/></a><figcaption>曾上載二人坐吊車去滑雪背影照（圖片來源：IG@austinauhinyeung）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179307132351527122_3689892056ae018dbca7f7.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"uorHjVaVAt0FlFBlFULLUF2zInn3c4X-TJFa90yRWvc.jpeg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179307132351527122_3689892056ae018dbca7f7.jpg\" width=\"807\"/></a><figcaption>譚旻萱同一時期亦發布了穿著同款服裝單人照（圖片來源：IG@tmh_xd）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179307132608343043_455189496ae018de67f85.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"austinauhinyeung_1773580675_3853396115773965509_207965317.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179307132608343043_455189496ae018de67f85.jpg\" width=\"807\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@austinauhinyeung）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179307132737354485_20205668256ae018dfa7ee4.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"ACtLNOGy67KPjIGEPPS4rfOnQHkJcavConBRC6JwUQs.jpeg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179307132737354485_20205668256ae018dfa7ee4.jpg\" width=\"807\"/></a><figcaption>區顯揚曾參與戀愛真人騷《35+LOVE》,與趙慧珊（Aka）擦出火花（圖片來源：IG@austinauhinyeung）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179292968085091343_17621832696addef91398f4.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"黃澤林 康堤 （圖片來源：threads）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179292968085091343_17621832696addef91398f4.jpg\" width=\"807\"/></a><figcaption>譚旻萱火速撻着黃澤林！（圖片來源：threads）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p>還有什麼演唱會消息？<i></i></p>\n<p>無論是本地歌手還是外地歌手都即將在香港舉行演唱會，即睇：<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E6%99%82%E9%96%93%E8%A1%A8-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8%E8%B3%87%E8%A8%8A-plt-777443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">演唱會時間表及購票資訊</a></b>，包括<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/mirror%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E8%A3%9C%E5%A0%B4-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-816344/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">MIRROR演唱會門票兌換安排</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E5%AE%B9%E7%A5%96%E5%85%92%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E6%BE%B3%E9%96%80-%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-plt-801047/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">容祖兒</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E9%84%AD%E7%A7%80%E6%96%87-%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E7%B4%85%E9%A4%A8-plt-807968/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鄭秀文</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E5%BC%B5%E5%AD%B8%E5%8F%8B-%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-786591/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">張學友</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E9%84%AD%E4%B8%AD%E5%9F%BA%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83%E6%BE%B3%E9%96%80-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-835218/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鄭中基</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E6%BA%AB%E6%8B%BF%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E5%94%AE%E7%A5%A8-plt-829876/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">溫拿</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E7%BE%85%E5%BF%97%E7%A5%A5%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E5%BA%A7%E4%BD%8D%E8%A1%A8-plt-835184/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">羅志祥</a></b>等。</p>\n<p>除了演唱會，還有什麼消閒娛樂活動？<i></i></p>\n<p>喜愛宅在家的話，觀看<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/netflix%E6%8E%A8%E8%96%A6-%E7%BE%8E%E5%8A%87-%E6%97%A5%E9%9F%93%E5%8F%B0%E5%8A%87-plt-576203/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Netflix劇集</a></b>和<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/bl%E5%8A%87-netflix-plt-583838/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">BL劇</a></b>最好不過。如果喜歡外出走走的你，也可到這些<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95/%E5%AE%A4%E5%85%A7%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-629923/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>室內遊樂場、溜冰場、自助烘焙店等盡玩室內活動。想要親親大自然，也可到離島走一走，即睇：<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-%E5%81%87%E6%9C%9F%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-%E9%9B%A2%E5%B3%B6%E4%B8%80%E6%97%A5%E9%81%8A-%E6%A2%85%E7%AA%A9-%E6%9D%B1%E9%BE%8D%E5%B3%B6-gt01-420918/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">離島行程攻略</a></b>或是行山，這些<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E9%83%8A%E9%81%8A/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E8%A1%8C%E5%B1%B1%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-%E7%B0%A1%E5%96%AE%E5%88%9D%E7%B4%9A%E6%96%B0%E6%89%8B%E8%B7%AF%E7%B7%9A-org115-515293/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>路線簡易，新手也適合。</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\nTags :\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e5%8d%80%e9%a1%af%e6%8f%9a/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">區顯揚</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e8%ad%9a%e6%97%bb%e8%90%b1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">譚旻萱</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e9%bb%83%e6%be%a4%e6%9e%97/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">黃澤林</a> </p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\n<p>\n資料或影片來源：<a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/3530850\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">原文刊於新假期</a>\n</p>\n</p><p></p>\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/category/%e7%94%9f%e6%b4%bb/%e5%a8%9b%e6%a8%82/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">娛樂</a>\nOct 27 2026\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-27T05:02:22.058203+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1597,"images":9,"source":"GoTrip","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-27T03:22:15+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-27T06:38:59.896357+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-27T04:59:01.725843+00:00","content_hash":"b637f3393d1989bda9d965c0a2f0854d1ba34380cf733a12dd24acf6b2f54b11","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}